# Croatian QUARTER hour.  Unlike "pola" (which counts toward the coming
# hour, 08:30 for "pola devet"), the quarter is only ever spoken with an
# explicit direction word -- "četvrt do devet" == 08:45 -- so
# ``bare_quarter_to`` is deliberately NOT set for hr and a bare
# "četvrt devet" stays unparsed rather than guessed.
# Citation: hjp.znanje.hr (Hrvatski jezicni portal), s.v. "četvrt":
# "četvrtina sata; petnaest minuta", with the clock example
# "četvrt do devet".
četvrt
četvrti
